#: ../../misc/todo.md:17
msgid ""
"Ubuntu 下的滚轮缩放和图像拖动有单独的反馈帖。补充反馈时请附系统版本、输入模式和具体鼠标操作。[#87 Ubuntu "
"缩放](https://github.com/nachifur/MulimgViewer/issues/87)、[#115 "
"拖动图片](https://github.com/nachifur/MulimgViewer/issues/115)"
msgstr ""
"Mouse-wheel zoom on Ubuntu and image dragging have separate threads. Include your OS version, "
"input mode, and exact mouse actions when reporting issues. [#87 Zoom on "
"Ubuntu](https://github.com/nachifur/MulimgViewer/issues/87), [#115 Dragging "
"images](https://github.com/nachifur/MulimgViewer/issues/115)"

#: ../../misc/todo.md:18
msgid ""
"视频导入、自动播放与多视频并排对比已有操作示例。可先依照手册打开两段视频，再在原议题补充仍有困难的场景。[操作示例](../resources/usage.md)、[#53 "
"视频并行对比](https://github.com/nachifur/MulimgViewer/issues/53)"
msgstr ""
"The manual covers video import, autoplay, and side-by-side comparison. Try the two-video "
"walkthrough and describe any remaining difficulties in the issue. "
"[Walkthrough](../resources/usage.md), [#53 Parallel video "
"comparison](https://github.com/nachifur/MulimgViewer/issues/53)"

#: ../../misc/todo.md:19
msgid ""
