"招募合作者](https://github.com/nachifur/MulimgViewer/issues/7)、[#222 "
"合作](https://github.com/nachifur/MulimgViewer/issues/222)"
msgstr ""
"For a Chinese interface or opportunities to collaborate, see the corresponding discussions. [#55 "
"Chinese interface](https://github.com/nachifur/MulimgViewer/issues/55), [#7 Seeking "
