"Collaboration](https://github.com/nachifur/MulimgViewer/issues/222)"

msgid "查找已实现的功能"
msgstr "Find features already available"

msgid "定位图片、同步放大和成组挑图见[操作录屏](../resources/usage.md)。框线、标题和导出比例见[设置栏参考](../resources/settings.md)。历次变化见[更新记录](changelog.md)，早期建议的贡献者见[致谢](acknowledgements.md)。"
msgstr "See the [recorded workflows](../resources/usage.md) for locating an image, magnifying a region and selecting a group. Box outlines, titles and export scale are documented in the [settings reference](../resources/settings.md). See the [changelog](changelog.md) for release history and the [credits](acknowledgements.md) for early contributions."
